WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
<v Dana, security desk>In January, we sent everyone a fake password reset.

2
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:10.120
<v Dana, security desk>Then 2 in 3 opened it, 1 in 3 clicked, and 1 in 12 typed a password.

3
00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:13.969
<v Dana, security desk>Only 1 in 7 told the security desk.
